%p Hi #{@user.full_name.presence || @user.email},
%p Someone has requested a link to change your Strutis password. You can do this through the link below:
%p{ style: 'margin: 16px 0;' }
  = link_to 'Change my password', edit_user_password_url(reset_password_token: @token)
%p If you didn't request this, ignore this email. Your password won't change until you access the link above and create a new one.
